{"miesto":"gen:ln:3","otazka":"Ukáž mi GEM pre tieto vektory krok po kroku v appke.","fotky":0,"zastavene":false,"text":"Vektory zapíš do **stĺpcov** matice. Nulovú pravú stranu homogénnej sústavy nemusíš písať, lebo pri riadkových úpravách ostáva nulová.\n\n<krokovac ref=\"k1\"\/>\n\n1. Úpravami $\\text{ř}2-2\\cdot\\text{ř}1$ a $\\text{ř}3+2\\cdot\\text{ř}1$ vynuluješ prvky pod prvým nenulovým prvkom prvého riadku.\n2. Úpravou $\\text{ř}3+\\text{ř}2$ dostaneš nulový tretí riadok. Matica je teraz v hornom stupňovitom tvare (HST).\n\nPrvý a druhý stĺpec sú hlavné. Tretí je vedľajší, takže koeficient pri treťom vektore je voľná neznáma.","nastroje":["gem"],"udalosti":[{"t":7,"e":"reset"},{"t":7,"e":"stav","d":"Premýšľam"},{"t":3267,"e":"stav","d":"Počítam GEM"},{"t":3269,"e":"reset"},{"t":3269,"e":"stav","d":"Píšem odpoveď"},{"t":5147,"e":"stav","d":""},{"t":5147,"e":"text","d":"V"},{"t":5147,"e":"text","d":"ekt"},{"t":5148,"e":"text","d":"ory"},{"t":5148,"e":"text","d":" zap"},{"t":5148,"e":"text","d":"íš"},{"t":5148,"e":"text","d":" do"},{"t":5256,"e":"text","d":" **"},{"t":5256,"e":"text","d":"st"},{"t":5257,"e":"text","d":"ĺ"},{"t":5257,"e":"text","d":"pc"},{"t":5513,"e":"text","d":"ov"},{"t":5513,"e":"text","d":"**"},{"t":5513,"e":"text","d":" mat"},{"t":5513,"e":"text","d":"ice"},{"t":5514,"e":"text","d":"."},{"t":5514,"e":"text","d":" N"},{"t":5514,"e":"text","d":"ul"},{"t":5514,"e":"text","d":"ov"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":"ú"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":" prav"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":"ú"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":" str"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":"anu"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":" homog"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":"én"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":"nej"},{"t":5707,"e":"text","d":" sú"},{"t":5708,"e":"text","d":"st"},{"t":5708,"e":"text","d":"avy"},{"t":5708,"e":"text","d":" nemus"},{"t":5817,"e":"text","d":"íš"},{"t":5817,"e":"text","d":" pí"},{"t":5817,"e":"text","d":"sa"},{"t":5817,"e":"text","d":"ť"},{"t":5817,"e":"text","d":","},{"t":5817,"e":"text","d":" le"}